[00:31.20]We taketh one small ember from the fire
[00:34.67]Before the last of it doth fade to grey
[00:38.03]We wrap it warm and hold it to the chest
[00:41.53]And we carry it into the dark away

[00:48.40]Through all the dark and all the biting winter
[00:51.86]Through every night the north shall ever know
[00:55.62]Through frost that cracketh stone and freezeth breath
[00:58.81]We keep the ember burning, soft and slow

[01:05.19]Vér segjum eigi farvel — we say not farewell!
[01:12.16]Vér heitum — we do vow!

[01:18.78]For when the ice doth break and spring returneth!
[01:25.86]And when the sun climbeth back into the sky!
[01:32.56]We shall returneth to these self-same stones!
[01:39.77]And we shall light the sea again — and never say goodbye!
[01:48.65]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[01:51.89]Skål to every summer yet to be!
[01:55.38]We keep the ember, we keep the flame!
[01:58.57]And the fire on the water shall burn free!

[02:16.59]Let the dark believe it hath us beaten
[02:20.28]Let the winter think the fire is done
[02:23.33]It knoweth not the ember in our keeping
[02:27.15]It knoweth not that we shall bring the sun

[02:33.11]Vér segjum eigi farvel — we say not farewell!
[02:40.61]Vér heitum — we do vow!

[02:46.91]For when the ice doth break and spring returneth!
[02:54.06]And when the sun climbeth back into the sky!
[03:00.60]We shall returneth to these self-same stones!
[03:07.67]And we shall light the sea again — and never say goodbye!
[03:16.62]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[03:19.76]Skål to every summer yet to be!
[03:23.29]We keep the ember, we keep the flame!
[03:26.71]And the fire on the water shall burn free!

[03:33.28]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir
[03:35.89]We yield the summer, yea
[03:39.33]But we keep a single ember
[03:43.00]Against the coming grey
[03:46.35]And we shall — we shall — RETURN!

[04:03.15]For when the ice doth break and spring returneth!
[04:09.49]And when the sun climbeth back into the sky!
[04:16.50]We shall returneth to these self-same stones!
[04:23.68]And we shall light the sea again — and never say goodbye!
[04:32.76]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[04:36.77]Skål to every summer yet to be!
[04:39.38]We keep the ember, we keep the flame!
[04:42.40]And the fire on the water shall burn free!

[04:46.22]Vér sjáumst aftr — we shall meet again
[04:51.24]Ljós á vatni — light upon the sea
[04:54.59]Sumar snýr aftr — the summer shall return
[04:59.90]Vér sjáumst aftr...
